Currently the subordinate KRA can only be installed using a deployment configuration file. Download sample configuration file [http://fedorapeople.org/cgit/edewata/public_git/pki-dev.git/tree/scripts/subkra.cfg subkra.cfg] and customize it as needed. Execute: 

<pre>
$ pkispawn -v -f subkra.cfg -s KRA
</pre>
